Package: cntvct-log
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Log ARM cntvct counter value for boot timing
 Reads the ARM counter-timer virtual count (CNTVCT) at boot to calculate
 the offset between power-on time and systemd monotonic time.
